why wouldn't the system be ready for your ministry to use?

5
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:20,740
Well, um, the checks before installation are really just reading documents.

6
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:26,480
They compare a screen to its original story, uh, or a model to the interaction design.

7
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:28,000
Right. It's all on paper.

8
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:33,780
Exactly. And, well, a pass on a document does not equal a working service for your program.

9
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:34,860
That makes sense.

10
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:43,880
Yeah. Without testing the running system, data can remain fragmented, siloed, um, duplicated, rekeyed-

