Wow... locked into one supplier, or even costly to change.

12
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:54,340
So does the specification-driven development method require a test that goes beyond, um, reading those documents?

13
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:59,260
It does. It requires the third rule of the specification-driven development method.

14
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:00,640
Okay. And

15
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,520
what is that rule exactly?

16
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:05,640
At least one check must end on the running system.

17
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:12,160
Uh, a real person must go through a real task on the installed application, and that run must be recorded.

18
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:17,840
